1. Android Mobile Application (Frontend)
Language: Kotlin (Modern, type-safe development)
UI Toolkit: Jetpack Compose (Declarative modern UI)
Design System: Material Design 3 (M3) with custom sustainability theming (Emerald & Mint Green palette, adaptive containers, accessibility contrast)
Architecture: MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel) with Unidirectional Data Flow (UDF)
Local Persistence: Android Room Database (SQLite abstraction with Kotlin Symbol Processing - KSP)
Concurrency & State: Kotlin Coroutines and StateFlow / SharedFlow (collectAsStateWithLifecycle)
Camera & Hardware Scanning: Jetpack CameraX (camera-core, camera-camera2, camera-lifecycle, camera-view) for real-time receipt viewfinder and photo capture
Image Loading: Coil Compose for async image rendering
Networking: OkHttp3 for HTTP client communication
Navigation: Jetpack Navigation with type-safe state transitions and animated crossfades
Build System: Gradle (Kotlin DSL - .gradle.kts) with Gradle Version Catalogs (libs.versions.toml)
Testing & Verification: Robolectric (JVM-based local unit & CUJ testing) and Roborazzi (Automated screenshot regression testing)
🧠 2. AI & Machine Learning Layer
Model: Google Gemini 1.5 Flash (Multimodal Vision & Language)
SDK: @google/genai and Gemini REST Endpoints
Key AI Capabilities:
Receipt OCR & Extraction: Parses grocery receipt items, extracts item names, infers categories, and calculates remaining shelf-life days.
Zero-Waste Recipe Synthesis: Formulates creative rescue recipes by prioritizing ingredients nearing expiration to prevent food waste.
🖥️ 3. Backend & Cloud Infrastructure
Runtime & Language: Node.js with TypeScript
Web Framework: Express.js
Database: PostgreSQL with connection pooling (pg)
Authentication: JSON Web Tokens (JWT) with bcryptjs password hashing
Data Validation: Zod for runtime schema validation
File Upload Handling: Multer (Memory storage for image processing)
Job Scheduler: node-cron for scheduled 08:00 AM daily expiry alert notifications
Containerization: Docker (Multi-stage build for Cloud Run, Render, or Railway)